<article class="env-lemma" id="05NG">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05NG">Lemma <span data-tag="05NG">17.17.5</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a ringed space. A filtered colimit of flat $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules is flat. A direct sum of flat $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules is flat. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/05NB" data-tag="05NB">17.16.5</a>, Lemma <a href="/tag/01CB" data-tag="01CB">17.16.1</a>, Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/00DB" data-tag="00DB">10.8.8</a>, and the fact that we can check exactness at stalks. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>